# Architecture

`src/index.ts` selects the public exports.
The greeting domain in `src/lib/greeting/index.ts` owns `greet`.
The shared domain owns `InvalidNameError` and imports no other domain.
Greeting imports shared. Implementation modules do not import the public entry point.

Replace the greeting example with the library and record its domain dependencies in the root `oxlint.config.ts`.
See the [package structure rules](../../../docs/agents/package-structure.md).
